.SH "Motivation"
.PP
\fBNode\fP class in the finite element mesh hierarchy stores the coordinate of the node point and the variables associated with the node\&.
.SH "Design Intent"
.PP
Mesh vertex with coordinates and associated flags\&. 
.br
.SH "Participants"
.PP
Uses \fBPoint<>\fP template to represent the coordinate\&. 
.br
.SH "Collaborations"
.PP
Elements are registered as parents, Faces and InterFaces are not\&. 
