.SS "template<uint32_t dim> bool \fBcsmp::Node\fP< dim >::operator== (const \fBNode\fP< dim > & nd)"

.PP
compares memory location, idx_, BREP classifier and boundary flag Tries to distinguish 2 nodes from one another\&.

.PP
This comparison operator was designed specifically for the creation of particular \fBRegion\fP, \fBBoundary\fP and \fBSplitBoundary\fP objects\&. Hence, only information important for this process is taken into account, distinguishing 2 Nodes from each other\&. That must be coordinate and parent elements 
